<title>USA: TABLE - Neose Tech Q2 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Neose Tech Q2 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>HORSHAM, Pa. 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the three months  For the six months</p>
<p>				  ended		     ended</p>
<p>				June 30,		  June 30,</p>
<p>			  1997	  1996	  1997	  1996</p>
<p>Revenues from collaborative</p>
<p>  agreements    $312,500     $356,100    $625,000    $693,600</p>
<p> Net loss    (2,041,987)  (1,583,753) (3,870,462) (3,230,298)</p>
<p>Net loss per share</p>
<p>			(0.22)	 (0.19)	(0.42)	(0.43)</p>
<p>Weighted average number of</p>
<p>common shares outstanding</p>
<p>		   9,495,000    8,176,000   9,295,000   7,492,000</p>
<p>NOTE:  The company said the decrease in the net loss per share for the first six months of 1997, was primarily attributable to an increase in the shares used in computing net loss per share subsequent to the issuance of common stock in its follow-on public offering of 1,250,000 shares in January 1997.</p>
<p>Neose Technologies Inc.</p>
